[{"title":"李希烈","author":"张晋","text":"席前流血任纵横，残忍鸱张本性成。\n滑石嘉祥频自诩，湿梢名字亦堪惊。\n临终断送来仙甫，余毒迁延到少诚。\n更羡含桃潜蜡帛，窦家女貌果倾城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37908,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"裴晋公度","author":"张晋","text":"旋袖齐传打麦谣，宰臣颅骨丧崇朝。\n何人更建平戎策，一出能令积寇消。\n圣主每思同唱和，远夷争欲睹丰标。\n暮年诗酒萧闲甚，绿野堂开傍午桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37909,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李太尉愬","author":"张晋","text":"飞雪漫天路不通，五更鹅鸭乱池中。\n是何常侍呼偏急，退保牙城计已穷。\n将士几人疑李佑，櫜鞬独自拜裴公。\n昌黎书法原无误，淮蔡平时第一功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37910,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李训郑注","author":"张晋","text":"夜来甘露降金吾，晓御含元列仗俱。\n幕下执兵看隐约，树边流汗费枝梧。\n才宣诏旨随班入，已决罘罳下殿趋。\n投鼠可怜忘忌器，尔曹安得有良图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37911,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李赞皇德裕","author":"张晋","text":"运筹决策仰风裁，藩镇凭陵势已摧。\n功阻受降谁失计，祸萌骖乘有同哀。\n朝廷何日除朋党，宰相如公信伟才。\n万里珠崖抛旅榇，梦中精爽尚能来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37912,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高骈","author":"张晋","text":"坐制东南意可知，中原盗贼任交驰。\n可怜后事输周宝，且欲三分效猘儿。\n楼上迎仙终未见，庭前乘鹄复谁欺。\n野乌入室成先兆，正是将军跋扈时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37913,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其一","author":"张晋","text":"洛阳迢递路间关，瞻顾园陵岂再还。\n飞去不知何处乐，一时流涕纥干山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37914,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其二","author":"张晋","text":"锦囊负矢马前来，意气当年亦壮哉。\n解道伶官能坐困，何缘驻马问愁台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37915,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其三","author":"张晋","text":"阉宦如公信楷模，丹心耿耿岂容诬。\n元凶未灭称尊号，毕竟吾王负老奴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37916,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其四","author":"张晋","text":"赭黄着体笑当年，愚愎公然号大燕。\n袛见主人曾避客，不闻尚父也郊天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37917,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其五","author":"张晋","text":"老将知兵未是夸，夹城一战势槎拿。\n军中只说周阳五，刺史何曾到野叉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37918,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其六","author":"张晋","text":"铁枪气压斗鸡儿，三日真符克敌期。\n暮晋朝梁人不少，有谁肯学豹留皮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37919,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其七","author":"张晋","text":"妖人治第博陵坊，野鹊黄蛇尽兆祥。\n不道后来西宅里，揕胸空欲啮云郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37920,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其八","author":"张晋","text":"提兵绕栅讶高呼，无槊凭陵意气粗。\n我亦沙陀求穴者，曾储肥肉犒军无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37921,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其九","author":"张晋","text":"旧事何劳问建丰，山人省女太匆匆。\n宫中正自夸门望，岂有黄须是阿翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37922,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十","author":"张晋","text":"妆奁满喜值无多，命本由天奈我何。\n马上一囊依旧在，抽刀枉自逐容哥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37923,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十一","author":"张晋","text":"郭门高竟负恩私，楼上先将一矢遗。\n余骨焚时烦乐器，果然终始不相离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37924,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十二","author":"张晋","text":"俳优殿上尽情歌，绝倒诙谐此辈多。\n切莫啮人纵儿女，同光原仗敬新磨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37925,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十三","author":"张晋","text":"角抵还将重镇酬，将军建节已堪羞。\n如何收得伶奴者，也向官家乞二州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37926,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十四","author":"张晋","text":"飧酪还能解渴无，绛霄廊下莫长吁。\n他年更上徽陵望，寒食谁持饭一盂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37927,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十五","author":"张晋","text":"华阳鹤氅学萧闲，门地虽高岂足攀。\n忘却此身本痴物，反将虫豸笑任团。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37928,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十六","author":"张晋","text":"厚葬何曾到九泉，摸金校尉不相怜。\n休将白骨求神庇，风雨干陵亦偶然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37929,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十七","author":"张晋","text":"逆谋原不比泉鸠，轻薄浮夸一旦休。\n试问苍黄床下伏，可曾厌铁在心头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37930,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十八","author":"张晋","text":"挝击庭前未及防，由来鸟尽合弓藏。\n九原若与安公见，切莫重新问潞王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37931,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其十九","author":"张晋","text":"凤翔兵变总由天，死不相从志已坚。\n却笑伶奴安十十，结欢苦费五条弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37932,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其二十","author":"张晋","text":"李严已困孟知祥，仁矩今看拜董璋。\n何似七郎家里住，无多残肉意难忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37933,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其二十一","author":"张晋","text":"三珠嘉兆又成空，胆堕那禁计更穷。\n独有举家焚死日，未将神语问张蒙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37934,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其二十二","author":"张晋","text":"卫州往事剧堪哀，转眼黄龙去不回。\n一样负心君莫恨，杜郎原效石郎来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37935,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其二十三","author":"张晋","text":"衣领藏书悔已迟，牙筹数毕罪何辞。\n可怜十万横磨剑，赚煞当年大眼儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37936,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读《五代史》杂咏三十九首 其二十四","author":"张晋","text":"天子如公作得无，兵强马壮笑区区。\n不因两箭夸神验，安得幡竿误铁胡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":37937,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fd